title: "GH-1545: preserve working package replacements through activation verification"
description: "GitHub #1545: a replacement whose activation fails overwrites the usable prior tree and managed metadata. Extend the existing install snapshot through runtime verification, restore prior state on replacement failure, and expose truthful preservation/recovery receipts across SDK and CLI."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 1
tags[3]: "area:packages","area:sdk","gh:1545"
